  "details": "Many vrchat items display features and shaders that VRChat quest avatars are forbidden to use. Things like a liquid shader on the water gun, a transparency shader that has a matcap on the sunglasses, these are things that quest avatars are not allowed to have. If the shaders are optimized enough to be used on the quest versions of official VRChat items, they should be whitelisted and made avalible in the Avatar SDK for Quest and iOS uploads.",
